```console
$ scherzo-cloud project runner-pool remove --help
Remove a project's runner pool

Usage: scherzo-cloud project runner-pool remove [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <PROJECT>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <PROJECT>       Exact project ID

Options:
      --json                 Print the project result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
